  <script>
  (function(){
    // Judge.me's review widget is a progressive enhancement: it can take a moment
    // to load (or, if the app embed isn't switched on in the theme editor, may
    // never load at all). Rather than risk an empty gap either way, show an
    // honest static message by default and only hide it once Judge.me actually
